<title>UK: Merrill sets warrants on European share basket.</title>
<headline>Merrill sets warrants on European share basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co has issued one million European-style call warrants, on a European focus basket, lead manager Merrill Lynch Internationals said.</p>
<p>The equally weighted basket includes shares of Elf Aquitaine,</p>
<p>AXA-UAP, L'Oreal, Deutsche Telecom,</p>
<p>Volkswagen AG, Novartis, Elsevier,</p>
<p>Ericsson, Nokia, STET and Telefonica De Espana.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    100.00 DEM		PREMIUM	11.40 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     11.40 DEM		 GEARING	8.77 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	20.N0V.98		 PAYDATE	11.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LONDON		    MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  100.00 DEM</p>
<p> NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE   MERU</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
